  message: "[+ tranche-05 chunk-1 F82.A5 — related] access_mode='write' also stamped on constructors (instantiates/ast_new) and collection mutations (append/add/extend) — a write-position-vs-I/O-write conflation distinct from the read-as-write mislabeling this invariant tracks. Filed as WI-hapab-tapav-lalav-moloz-dopap-gipap-hovin-karuj."  # a0cb
