  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0038, merged in PR #4181): access_mode is rebuilt per-edge from the AST role rather than inherited from emitter defaults, with a validator rule that ast_name_read implies access_mode != write; the 'mutate' cell is kept. Stays violated until the per-edge rebuild lands; re-validate against the new validator rule."  # d546
